//pbs.twimg.com/media/Fx3DKvQXwAInGiB?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1334,"height":1078}],"quote":null},{"id":"1665706050035523584","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1665706050035523584","text":"GBTC was probably @Qullamaggie biggest intraday trade in 2017\n\nHe made over $135,000 in a single day (about 10% of his account)\n\n$100,000+ of this was from the GBTC trade\n\nHere's the 1.5-month run-up and how it played out intraday \n\n👇","timestampShown":"6:04 AM · Jun 5, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-05T06:04:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 5, 2023 · 6:04 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-05","tickers":[],"searchText":"gbtc was probably @qullamaggie biggest intraday trade in 2017\n\nhe made over $135,000 in a single day (about 10% of his account)\n\n$100,000+ of this was from the gbtc trade\n\nhere's the 1.5-month run-up and how it played out intraday \n\n👇\n6:04 am · jun 5, 2023\njun 5, 2023 · 6:04 am\n2023-06-05\n","images":[{"src":"images/1665706050035523584_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fx3G0sFXgAEJW_v?format=jpg&name=orig","width":712,"height":1200}],"quote":null},{"id":"1665718392119066624","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1665718392119066624","text":"It's not possible to not hear something news-related 🗞️🔊 (Chatrooms, Tiktok, news, etc)\n\nWhat helped me was to think:\n\n\"I don't see the full picture and I'm too stupid to figure it out myself. I can't let this influence my decision\" 🤔🚫💡","timestampShown":"6:53 AM · Jun 5, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-05T06:53:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 5, 2023 · 6:53 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-05","tickers":[],"searchText":"it's not possible to not hear something news-related 🗞️🔊 (chatrooms, tiktok, news, etc)\n\nwhat helped me was to think:\n\n\"i don't see the full picture and i'm too stupid to figure it out myself. i can't let this influence my decision\" 🤔🚫💡\n6:53 am · jun 5, 2023\njun 5, 2023 · 6:53 am\n2023-06-05\n","images":[{"src":"images/1665718392119066624_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fx3SDC3XgAMXLUX?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1919,"height":1079}],"quote":null},{"id":"1665737265593688065","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1665737265593688065","text":"Doing something outside of the market is not a problem for most of us, as we have full-time jobs\n\nI used to think that I had to put on a trade when I sat down at the desk\n\nI now consider it an edge to not be a full-time trader\n\nAlthough doing it full-time would be preferable","timestampShown":"8:08 AM · Jun 5, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-05T08:08:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 5, 2023 · 8:08 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-05","tickers":[],"searchText":"doing something outside of the market is not a problem for most of us, as we have full-time jobs\n\ni used to think that i had to put on a trade when i sat down at the desk\n\ni now consider it an edge to not be a full-time trader\n\nalthough doing it full-time would be preferable\n8:08 am · jun 5, 2023\njun 5, 2023 · 8:08 am\n2023-06-05\n","images":[{"src":"images/1665737265593688065_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fx3jNolWAAA3eA2?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1919,"height":1079}],"quote":null},{"id":"1666064410102603777","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666064410102603777","text":"It's more important to stick to good enough rules than to constantly try to use the optimal rules","timestampShown":"5:48 AM · Jun 6, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-06T05:48:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 6, 2023 · 5:48 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-06","tickers":[],"searchText":"it's more important to stick to good enough rules than to constantly try to use the optimal rules\n5:48 am · jun 6, 2023\njun 6, 2023 · 5:48 am\n2023-06-06\n","images":[{"src":"images/1666064410102603777_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fx8Mv9RWIAQDlYJ?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1355,"height":1079}],"quote":null},{"id":"1666080783281553418","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666080783281553418","text":"It's not just putting in hundreds of hours studying past winners and building conviction that's important 📚⏰\n\nLearning to listen to the market and identifying institutional accumulation and theme plays is critical\n\nThe backwatchlist plays an important role in this work📝🔍","timestampShown":"6:53 AM · Jun 6, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-06T06:53:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 6, 2023 · 6:53 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-06","tickers":[],"searchText":"it's not just putting in hundreds of hours studying past winners and building conviction that's important 📚⏰\n\nlearning to listen to the market and identifying institutional accumulation and theme plays is critical\n\nthe backwatchlist plays an important role in this work📝🔍\n6:53 am · jun 6, 2023\njun 6, 2023 · 6:53 am\n2023-06-06\n","images":[{"src":"images/1666080783281553418_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fx8botvagAAJ_Vx?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1919,"height":1079}],"quote":null},{"id":"1666099646333059072","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666099646333059072","text":"I didn't use to listen to the market\n\nI didn't even know it was telling me things\n\nNow I don't put on any trades (unless they are A++) without being able to answer what the market is telling me","timestampShown":"8:08 AM · Jun 6, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-06T08:08:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 6, 2023 · 8:08 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-06","tickers":[],"searchText":"i didn't use to listen to the market\n\ni didn't even know it was telling me things\n\nnow i don't put on any trades (unless they are a++) without being able to answer what the market is telling me\n8:08 am · jun 6, 2023\njun 6, 2023 · 8:08 am\n2023-06-06\n","images":[{"src":"images/1666099646333059072_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fx8sy15WYAE7fZJ?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1919,"height":1078}],"quote":null},{"id":"1666443149223313410","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666443149223313410","text":"Having reviewed over 1732 of Qullamaggie's trades, I have found that valuable insights can be learned from failed trades just as much as from successful trades\n\nThe BLDP trade is a good example of this 👇","timestampShown":"6:53 AM · Jun 7, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-07T06:53:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 7, 2023 · 6:53 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-07","tickers":[],"searchText":"having reviewed over 1732 of qullamaggie's trades, i have found that valuable insights can be learned from failed trades just as much as from successful trades\n\nthe bldp trade is a good example of this 👇\n6:53 am · jun 7, 2023\njun 7, 2023 · 6:53 am\n2023-06-07\n\nthat could've, would've, should've feeling when you see stocks go without you?🚀\n\nit's not going away🙅‍♂️\n\nbldp was a textbook theme stock and made a 600% move after qullamaggie first entry in oct '19\n\nhe missed most of the gains\n\n37 lessons i learned from this trade👣 👇\n6:53 am · may 24, 2023\nmay 24, 2023 · 6:53 am\n2023-05-24","images":[],"quote":{"id":"1661369741083017217","url":"https://x.com/i/status/1661369741083017217","text":"That could've, would've, should've feeling when you see stocks go without you?🚀\n\nIt's not going away🙅‍♂️\n\nBLDP was a textbook theme stock and made a 600% move after Qullamaggie first entry in Oct '19\n\nHe missed most of the gains\n\n37 lessons I learned from this trade👣 👇","timestampShown":"6:53 AM · May 24, 2023","timestamp":"2023-05-24T06:53:00","timestampLabel":"May 24, 2023 · 6:53 AM","images":[{"src":"images/1666443149223313410_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fw5e-NvWYAA69Mw?format=jpg&name=orig","width":2575,"height":1275}],"inArchive":true}},{"id":"1666462086061342722","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666462086061342722","text":"Institutional FOMO is a real thing, and the charts tell the story. 📊😮🏦\n\nRETA in October 2019 is an example📈📅\n\nQullamaggie talked about it after it gapped up 45% 😲📈💼\n\nIt went on to make 45% in 20 days 📈💰📆","timestampShown":"8:08 AM · Jun 7, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-07T08:08:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 7, 2023 · 8:08 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-07","tickers":[],"searchText":"institutional fomo is a real thing, and the charts tell the story. 📊😮🏦\n\nreta in october 2019 is an example📈📅\n\nqullamaggie talked about it after it gapped up 45% 😲📈💼\n\nit went on to make 45% in 20 days 📈💰📆\n8:08 am · jun 7, 2023\njun 7, 2023 · 8:08 am\n2023-06-07\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1666486935689256971","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666486935689256971","text":"Unpopular opinion, but: I'm no longer convinced using market monitors, indexes, McClellan oscillator, new higs/lows, etc is the best way to gauge favourable market conditions\n\nThese can all give false positives.. and they are also all lagging\n\nWill have to study this more","timestampShown":"9:47 AM · Jun 7, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-07T09:47:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 7, 2023 · 9:47 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-07","tickers":[],"searchText":"unpopular opinion, but: i'm no longer convinced using market monitors, indexes, mcclellan oscillator, new higs/lows, etc is the best way to gauge favourable market conditions\n\nthese can all give false positives.. and they are also all lagging\n\nwill have to study this more\n9:47 am · jun 7, 2023\njun 7, 2023 · 9:47 am\n2023-06-07\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1666509615423541248","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666509615423541248","text":"Trading is tough. \n\nIt's even tougher when you take real life into account\n\nWas exhausted after work yesterday, but had already made plans, so didnt get a minute of rest between work, making dinner for family, and socializing with friends in the afternoon\n\nCame home just in time for bed time for the oldest. She's sick, so didnt fall a sleep until way too late. Slept horribly, waking up every 30 minutes. \n\nWhen the oldest had finally come to rest, the youngest started acting out. I fell asleep at 0345. \n\nGot up again at 0645 to take the oldest to kindergarten before heading to work. Boss is really stressed as we are approaching a deadline and we are way behind schedule.\n\nNow I'm sick and feel misrable. Mentally and physically.\n\nI have overstayed my welcome in some trades and taken some uneccerary/too risky trades.\n\nFelt like just putting everything into some random microcap runner.. but luckily I know that wont help me in the long run.\n\nHang in there people! I am sure Im not alone","timestampShown":"11:17 AM · Jun 7, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-07T11:17:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 7, 2023 · 11:17 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-07","tickers":[],"searchText":"trading is tough. \n\nit's even tougher when you take real life into account\n\nwas exhausted after work yesterday, but had already made plans, so didnt get a minute of rest between work, making dinner for family, and socializing with friends in the afternoon\n\ncame home just in time for bed time for the oldest. she's sick, so didnt fall a sleep until way too late. slept horribly, waking up every 30 minutes. \n\nwhen the oldest had finally come to rest, the youngest started acting out. i fell asleep at 0345. \n\ngot up again at 0645 to take the oldest to kindergarten before heading to work. boss is really stressed as we are approaching a deadline and we are way behind schedule.\n\nnow i'm sick and feel misrable. mentally and physically.\n\ni have overstayed my welcome in some trades and taken some uneccerary/too risky trades.\n\nfelt like just putting everything into some random microcap runner.. but luckily i know that wont help me in the long run.\n\nhang in there people! i am sure im not alone\n11:17 am · jun 7, 2023\njun 7, 2023 · 11:17 am\n2023-06-07\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1666805536711655424","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666805536711655424","text":"📚🧠 Studying and building conviction isn't just about setups\n\n🔮 One of the things I've become a lot more comfortable with lately is not having expectations going into trades🙌\n\nQullamaggie didn't know HMNY was gonna be one of his biggest trades of 2017","timestampShown":"6:53 AM · Jun 8, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-08T06:53:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 8, 2023 · 6:53 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-08","tickers":[],"searchText":"📚🧠 studying and building conviction isn't just about setups\n\n🔮 one of the things i've become a lot more comfortable with lately is not having expectations going into trades🙌\n\nqullamaggie didn't know hmny was gonna be one of his biggest trades of 2017\n6:53 am · jun 8, 2023\njun 8, 2023 · 6:53 am\n2023-06-08\n\nhmny was one of qullamaggies best trades in 2017\n\nhe made $200,000 on the long side, and $100,000 on the short side\n\nhere's 17 lessons i learned studying this trade\n\n👇\n\nps: his own review is at the end\n7:00 am · may 9, 2023\nmay 9, 2023 · 7:00 am\n2023-05-09","images":[],"quote":{"id":"1655935734732427265","url":"https://x.com/i/status/1655935734732427265","text":"HMNY was one of Qullamaggies best trades in 2017\n\nHe made $200,000 on the long side, and $100,000 on the short side\n\nHere's 17 lessons I learned studying this trade\n\n👇\n\nPS: His own review is at the end","timestampShown":"7:00 AM · May 9, 2023","timestamp":"2023-05-09T07:00:00","timestampLabel":"May 9, 2023 · 7:00 AM","images":[{"src":"images/1666805536711655424_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FvsQxRbakAwA1Go?format=jpg&name=orig","width":962,"height":1572}],"inArchive":true}},{"id":"1666824471364116480","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666824471364116480","text":"Stocks don't come with a \"past performance is not indicative of future results\" disclaimer. 📈🚫⏳\n\nQullamaggie tells us to stick to stocks which make linear moves  ➡️📈, not random pos stocks 👇","timestampShown":"8:08 AM · Jun 8, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-08T08:08:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 8, 2023 · 8:08 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-08","tickers":[],"searchText":"stocks don't come with a \"past performance is not indicative of future results\" disclaimer. 📈🚫⏳\n\nqullamaggie tells us to stick to stocks which make linear moves  ➡️📈, not random pos stocks 👇\n8:08 am · jun 8, 2023\njun 8, 2023 · 8:08 am\n2023-06-08\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1666849333247967234","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1666849333247967234","text":"Qullamaggie hasn't always been a millionaire 💰🚫😉\n\nTSLA, on June 16th 2014, was one of the first classic breakouts he traded\n\nIt made him about $4,000 in a couple of days\n\n6.5 years later he made 200 times that shorting the same stock 🔽💰📈\n\nEveryone starts somewhere 🙌🌟","timestampShown":"9:47 AM · Jun 8, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-08T09:47:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 8, 2023 · 9:47 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-08","tickers":[],"searchText":"qullamaggie hasn't always been a millionaire 💰🚫😉\n\ntsla, on june 16th 2014, was one of the first classic breakouts he traded\n\nit made him about $4,000 in a couple of days\n\n6.5 years later he made 200 times that shorting the same stock 🔽💰📈\n\neveryone starts somewhere 🙌🌟\n9:47 am · jun 8, 2023\njun 8, 2023 · 9:47 am\n2023-06-08\n","images":[{"src":"images/1666849333247967234_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FyHWojEX0AIMhrl?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1086,"height":689}],"quote":null},{"id":"1667168006173065218","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667168006173065218","text":"Just because Qullamaggie has drawn a lot of inspiration from William O'Neil doesn't mean he has to agree with everything he has said. 🎨💡😊","timestampShown":"6:53 AM · Jun 9, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-09T06:53:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 9, 2023 · 6:53 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-09","tickers":[],"searchText":"just because qullamaggie has drawn a lot of inspiration from william o'neil doesn't mean he has to agree with everything he has said. 🎨💡😊\n6:53 am · jun 9, 2023\njun 9, 2023 · 6:53 am\n2023-06-09\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1667186826371645443","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667186826371645443","text":"\"If you're waiting for volume confirmation on breakouts, you're doing it wrong. 🙅‍♂️\"\n\nOnly about half of breakout trades see volume exceed the average 50-day  $volume before lunch. ⏰\"","timestampShown":"8:08 AM · Jun 9, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-09T08:08:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 9, 2023 · 8:08 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-09","tickers":["VOLUME"],"searchText":"\"if you're waiting for volume confirmation on breakouts, you're doing it wrong. 🙅‍♂️\"\n\nonly about half of breakout trades see volume exceed the average 50-day  $volume before lunch. ⏰\"\n8:08 am · jun 9, 2023\njun 9, 2023 · 8:08 am\n2023-06-09\n$volume","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1667214070443851778","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667214070443851778","text":"Knowing what type of stock you're trading is important as it dictates how it should be treated and what to look for. 🔍💼💡\n\nQullamaggie explaining the two types of stocks we trade 👇","timestampShown":"9:56 AM · Jun 9, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-09T09:56:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 9, 2023 · 9:56 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-09","tickers":[],"searchText":"knowing what type of stock you're trading is important as it dictates how it should be treated and what to look for. 🔍💼💡\n\nqullamaggie explaining the two types of stocks we trade 👇\n9:56 am · jun 9, 2023\njun 9, 2023 · 9:56 am\n2023-06-09\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1667249305923493891","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667249305923493891","text":"Started working my way through 🦁 @traderlion Conference presentations📚\n\nActively taking notes on all presentations to ensure I'm actively listening and for spaced repetition🔁📝 \n\nFirst out is @jaredtendler🎤\n\nIf there's any interest, I'm happy to share all of the notes📋","timestampShown":"12:16 PM · Jun 9, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-09T12:16:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 9, 2023 · 12:16 PM","dateKey":"2023-06-09","tickers":[],"searchText":"started working my way through 🦁 @traderlion conference presentations📚\n\nactively taking notes on all presentations to ensure i'm actively listening and for spaced repetition🔁📝 \n\nfirst out is @jaredtendler🎤\n\nif there's any interest, i'm happy to share all of the notes📋\n12:16 pm · jun 9, 2023\njun 9, 2023 · 12:16 pm\n2023-06-09\n","images":[{"src":"images/1667249305923493891_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FyNCZ9zXwAAWjdS?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1098,"height":1079}],"quote":null},{"id":"1667509196365914112","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667509196365914112","text":"They traded high volume gappers in 1959 as well","timestampShown":"5:29 AM · Jun 10, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-10T05:29:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 10, 2023 · 5:29 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-10","tickers":[],"searchText":"they traded high volume gappers in 1959 as well\n5:29 am · jun 10, 2023\njun 10, 2023 · 5:29 am\n2023-06-10\n","images":[{"src":"images/1667509196365914112_1.jpg","remote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FyQuxnWXoAEsLpv?format=jpg&name=orig","width":759,"height":1150}],"quote":null},{"id":"1667542960898965506","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667542960898965506","text":"Linearity is a key characteristic of the stocks we want to be in 🚀\n\nIt's the telltale sign of a stock being institutional grade \n\nQullamaggie giving struggling trader feedback 👇","timestampShown":"7:43 AM · Jun 10, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-10T07:43:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 10, 2023 · 7:43 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-10","tickers":[],"searchText":"linearity is a key characteristic of the stocks we want to be in 🚀\n\nit's the telltale sign of a stock being institutional grade \n\nqullamaggie giving struggling trader feedback 👇\n7:43 am · jun 10, 2023\njun 10, 2023 · 7:43 am\n2023-06-10\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1667590458292174851","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667590458292174851","text":"What's the best indicator for speculation money flowing into the market?","timestampShown":"10:52 AM · Jun 10, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-10T10:52:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 10, 2023 · 10:52 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-10","tickers":[],"searchText":"what's the best indicator for speculation money flowing into the market?\n10:52 am · jun 10, 2023\njun 10, 2023 · 10:52 am\n2023-06-10\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1667868363702370304","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667868363702370304","text":"When a stock is under institutional accumulation, the chart tells us 📈🔍📊.\n\nALB in June 2020 was one of those charts. 📈📅🚀","timestampShown":"5:16 AM · Jun 11, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-11T05:16:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 11, 2023 · 5:16 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-11","tickers":[],"searchText":"when a stock is under institutional accumulation, the chart tells us 📈🔍📊.\n\nalb in june 2020 was one of those charts. 📈📅🚀\n5:16 am · jun 11, 2023\njun 11, 2023 · 5:16 am\n2023-06-11\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1667876340408766467","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667876340408766467","text":"\"I'll just refund my account if this trade goes bad\"\n\nThat was my thinking on at least 3 of my account blowups 😫💣\n\nIt's irrational and I could've just as well spent my money on lottery tickets🎟️\n\nIt was only after I approached trading as if it was my livelihood I saw progress💪","timestampShown":"5:48 AM · Jun 11, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-11T05:48:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 11, 2023 · 5:48 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-11","tickers":[],"searchText":"\"i'll just refund my account if this trade goes bad\"\n\nthat was my thinking on at least 3 of my account blowups 😫💣\n\nit's irrational and i could've just as well spent my money on lottery tickets🎟️\n\nit was only after i approached trading as if it was my livelihood i saw progress💪\n5:48 am · jun 11, 2023\njun 11, 2023 · 5:48 am\n2023-06-11\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1667966635192320001","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1667966635192320001","text":"What do you use to structure your studies and research?","timestampShown":"11:46 AM · Jun 11, 2023","timestamp":"2023-06-11T11:46:00","timestampLabel":"Jun 11, 2023 · 11:46 AM","dateKey":"2023-06-11","tickers":[],"searchText":"what do you use to structure your studies and research?\n11:46 am · jun 11, 2023\njun 11, 2023 · 11:46 am\n2023-06-11\n","images":[],"quote":null},{"id":"1668237744978419719","url":"https://x.com/Muninn/status/1668237744978419719","te